## Test integrity

The original test is unchanged (`resolve.test.js:12-15` matches `git show edfed82`). There is no `skip`, `todo` or `only`. Expected values are built with `join`, `sep` and `resolve`, and no real files are touched, so the tests are platform-independent by construction. The implementer reported running them on Windows only, and I ran them on neither platform.
